5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"We need to stop guessing. I want to know exactly how many bikes leave between seven and nine, and where the rain hits.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I want to verify the actual costs. I’ll check the building ledger and the station park fees to see what we’re really paying.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,"I suspect the current arrangement is just habit, not fairness. I’ll review the five years of minutes and the sticker register to see who actually holds the spaces.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I’m checking the complaint log and the neighbouring block’s account. I want to see what happens when these rules start biting people.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m checking the treasurer’s handover file and the supplier’s display frame. I need to know the real workload and physical effort involved before we commit to anything.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, if the station park is cheaper than our internal costs, why not just send everyone there?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, I’m not assuming it’s cheaper. I need the ledger to confirm our actual baseline before comparing it to external fees.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"@Mio, the physical effort is important, but I need to know if the current holders are actually using the spaces or just hoarding them.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@George, the complaint log shows friction, but the neighbor’s account shows social collapse. I need to know if we’re trading one problem for a worse one.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@George, hoarding is a real risk, but if the racks are too heavy to use, people will just abandon them anyway.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, social collapse is a risk, but so is the daily shoving match. I need to know if the physical layout is forcing the conflict.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, the shoving match is a symptom, not the root cause. I need to know if the financial burden is what’s actually driving people to fight over space.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,"@Ryuji, money is only part of it. I need to see if the same doors have held these spots for years without any review.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@George, habit isn't a defense. If the arrangement is unfair, it needs fixing, not just documenting.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, I agree that fairness matters, but if the new system is too hard to maintain, it will just fail and leave us worse off.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I’ll look into the morning departures and the rain exposure. I need to see if the physical layout is forcing the conflict.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
